MSDOSCOPY 1.42

This program will allow to copy programs from a MS-DOS disk (3 1/2",DD)
to any CBM DOS disk.
Minimum configuration:
C64, 1581 configured as #9, any drive configured as #8.

For detailed info see the docs, contained in the file MSDOSCOPY.SDA.

